      "eigenerOrdner": true,
      "nr": 52,
      "nameEn": "Alpha 1.40.0",
      "neuEn": "Story goals and sound: New: the first time you enter a world, the game asks if you want to follow the story. Say yes and goals guide you, top right with an arrow, the distance and a golden beam, from the first watchtower to the chained golem. Say no and it stays a pure sandbox. Press J to switch anytime. Fixed: no sound on PCs without OpenAL installed, the game now brings its own. Changed: messages no longer replace each other and wait until a fight calms down, and the torch next to the cannons uses the new model.",
