      "eigenerOrdner": true,
      "nr": 53,
      "nameEn": "Alpha 1.41.0",
      "neuEn": "Blood moon: New: three game modes (Sandbox, Adventure, Challenge), day and night in every world, blood moon raids on your base with field cannons, watchtowers with Melvin at the top, a poison moon with acid rain, a saving screen when you leave a world and a new main menu. Challenge has only four lives. Changed: divers only attack when you strike first or during a raid, deeper and punchier sounds, more weight when you walk, short notes at the top instead of long messages, and music only plays during raids.",
